guide forever/miscellaneous/cozy-sleeping-bag
title Cozy Sleeping Bag
category Miscellaneous
keywords Cozy Sleeping Bag, Old Toolbox, Student Fodder, ... and that note you found, Stepping Stones, Scramble, Wet Job, Eagle's Fist, This Must Be The Place, Burned-Out Remains, Nailed Plank, Thoradin's Wall
collects 211527, 221498
reward item 211527
reward item 221498
why A trail of hidden notes across both continents: the Cozy Sleeping Bag at the end, a 12-slot Old Toolbox on the way.
levels 14-32
zone Westfall

# The six-quest chain Forever kept from Season of Discovery, at lower levels
# (22-32, needs 14). Every quest starts and ends at a game object; none has
# objectives, so each step is a hand-in at the next hiding place.
# Sources:
# - Quests, objects and their spawns: data/forever (QuestieDB Forever):
#   79008 / 79007 ... and that note you found, 79192 Stepping Stones, 79980
#   Scramble, 79974 Wet Job, 79975 Eagle's Fist, 79976 This Must Be The Place.
# - The order per faction: 79008 (Alliance) starts at the Westfall remains
#   (415107) and ends at the Barrens ones (415106, Nailed Plank 417072); 79007
#   (Horde) the reverse (Westfall Nailed Plank 424010). Stepping Stones starts
#   at either plank.
# - Rewards (Old Toolbox 221498 from Stepping Stones; Cozy Sleeping Bag 211527
#   and Student Fodder from This Must Be The Place), the path into the
#   Stonetalon hills (about 50.9,52.3) and the climb to the Messenger Bag from
#   the Hillsbrad side of Thoradin's Wall (a fallen cart against the wall, about
#   87.5,47.7 in Hillsbrad Foothills): Wowhead's Forever quest pages and their
#   comments, from the local archive, facts only.
# Not play-tested on Forever yet.

step The note in Westfall
  only Alliance
  tip A burned-out campfire in western Westfall, with a nailed plank beside it.
  accept 79008

step Its twin in the Barrens
  only Alliance
  zone The Barrens
  tip The note's "twin land" is the Barrens: the same burned-out campfire stands in the southern Barrens.
  turnin 79008
  accept 79192 object 417072

step The note in the Barrens
  only Horde
  zone The Barrens
  tip A burned-out campfire in the southern Barrens, with a nailed plank beside it.
  accept 79007

step Its twin in Westfall
  only Horde
  zone Westfall
  tip The note's "twin land" is Westfall: the same burned-out campfire stands in western Westfall.
  turnin 79007
  accept 79192 object 424010

step Stonetalon Mountains
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip The next hideout is a small camp in the hills of eastern Stonetalon. Leave the road where a path climbs into the hills and follow it to the camp; the Pocket Litter lies on a crate beside its tent.
  goto 50.9,52.3 "Path into the hills"
  turnin 79192
  accept 79980

step A hundred paces north
  tip Walk north through the camp and drop carefully down the steep slope to the Mound of Dirt on the ledge below. A missed jump only slides you down: hug the cliff and walk back up.
  turnin 79980
  accept 79974

step The dam in Loch Modan
  zone Loch Modan
  tip The figurine is on a ledge just below the top of the Stonewrought Dam, on its north face. Step off slowly; walking backwards keeps you from overshooting the ledge.
  turnin 79974
  accept 79975

step Thoradin's Wall
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip At the gate in Thoradin's Wall between Arathi and Hillsbrad, turn north and follow the wall on the Hillsbrad side to a fallen cart leaning against it. Jump up the cart and its ladder onto the wall, then over the rocks to the hidden camp. Some characters cannot fit under the cargo netting at the camp; another race or a smaller form gets through.
  goto 87.5,47.7 "Fallen cart"

step The hidden camp
  zone Arathi Highlands
  turnin 79975
  accept 79976
  turnin 79976
